            <ArticleTitle>Detection of Anderson-Fabry cardiomyopathy with CMR in a patient with chest pain and elevated cardiac biomarkers.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>399-404</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case illustrates the utility of CMR in evaluating a patient with undiagnosed Anderson-Fabry disease who presented with chest pain, elevated cardiac biomarkers, normal coronary arteries, and an abnormal echocardiogram.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
